{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-00942-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["법무부는 “내용이 왜곡됐다”며 해당 문자 메시지를 공개했다","이 국장이 인사 발표 전날 ... A검사에게 보낸 것이다","윤 총장이 “법무부에서 인사안을 먼저 만들어 보내는 게 맞다”고 지적"],"reason":"The summary says 이 국장 disclosed the text, but the SOURCE says 법무부 disclosed it, so the actor is wrong. It also leaves out the text's thankful content, which is the key fact in the dispute. The 윤 총장 dispute is stated awkwardly and the claim that 법무부 said the content was distorted is garbled."},"B":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["“전혀 사실이 아니다”면서도 “이 국장이 인사 발표 전날 ... 문자를 보낸 사실이 있다”","“늘 감사…덕분에 여기까지 왔다”"],"reason":"It says 법무부 stated that the text was NOT sent, which reverses the SOURCE: 법무부 confirmed the text was sent. It also leaves out the text's thankful content and the 법무부 claim of distortion."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["내용이 왜곡됐다”며 해당 문자 메시지를 공개했다","다음날 검찰인사위원회가 잡혔다는 사실도 밤 늦게 대검에 통보됐다"],"reason":"It is accurate on the controversy, the 법무부 disclosure, the confirmation that the text was sent, and the 주광덕 claim. It leaves out the text's thankful content, which shows it was not mocking, and the 13일 start date. The background about 윤 총장 is included but is not the central point."},"D":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["12일 법무부는 ... 문자를 보낸 사실이 있다","13일 정식 부임한다"],"reason":"It is accurate and concise, covering the controversy, the disclosure, the confirmed text, the start date and the 주광덕 claim. It leaves out the text's thankful content, the key evidence against the mocking claim."}}}
